WEBVTT

NOTE
The Timber train mission — the SeeD team's train pursuing President Deling's train.
Duration: approximately 26 seconds.

00:00.000 --> 00:06.000
Close-up of the President train speeding through trees—locomotive, red wagon with gold filigree, and green wagon, all racing through the forest

00:06.000 --> 00:08.000
The mechanical arm detaches the two wagons—mission successful

00:08.000 --> 00:13.000
Two tracks now: one where other train speeds by, while the detached wagon slowly slows down

00:13.000 --> 00:17.000
From the second track, the speeding SeeD orange pusher locomotive 'Raiders' switches lanes, intercepting the path of the train ahead

00:17.000 --> 00:26.000
The two trains connect, the unlinked train attaching to the orange pusher locomotive 'Raiders,' bumping the timber train ahead. From an aerial view, they’re seamlessly aligned on a single track
